id: session-agent-operator
name: Session Agent Operator
triggers: session, history, conversation, agent, subagent, delegate, status
description: Guides session history, agent routing, and sub-agent coordination.

Use session_status for quick status.
Use sessions_list to inspect lanes.
Use sessions_history when the user says earlier messages are missing.
Use sessions_spawn to create a new lane.
Use sessions_send/message to route a message into another agent/session.
Use subagents or delegate_task when the user wants builder/research/ops style routing.

Never pretend a new chat has memory if the transcript is unavailable; inspect sessions_history or memory first.
